# L §4.4 A movement takes a day, §5.19 Holes, §5.14.2 (tally 2.3, #247; the plan's S6, planner/hd/hd2.tally with
# windows for its ? days): a decision dated by a window is a hole day, its place the hole on every day, a pin of its cell
# answering it (s_pin); a plan dated by a window and fulfilled by an observation is answered by it once the statement
# is known (L §5.19: the observation gives the day), the hole at a cut before. Before: the decision's window kept its
# stretch (s_jan 500.00 PLN).
=== m.tally
model hd2
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input pd: date
input dd: date
input bank: observed
move pay_x: transfers
  on pd
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move sweep: transfers
  on dd
  reads sav
  leg cash from sav to world amount min(bal(sav), pay)
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  pd = window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-31) "c"
  dd = window(2026-05-01, 2026-05-10) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[sav] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version st
  cite card
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-01
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-12, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_x) "line 1"
ask b_feb_before: bal(konto, 2026-02-15) as known 2026-03-01
ask b_feb_seen: bal(konto, 2026-02-15)
ask b_apr_seen: bal(konto, 2026-04-05)
ask day_seen: pay_x.day
ask s_jan: bal(sav, 2026-01-15)
ask s_dec: bal(sav, 2026-12-31)
ask s_pin: bal(sav, 2026-12-31) with dd = 2026-05-05
=== expect
b_apr_seen: 600.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
b_feb_before: ?"date within window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-31) not precise enough for the day of pay_x" (pd)
  unknown day: pd
  cut 2026-03-01
b_feb_seen: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
day_seen: ...
...
s_dec: ?"date within window(2026-05-01, 2026-05-10) not precise enough for the day of sweep" (dd)
  unknown day: dd
  cut 2026-04-20
s_jan: ?"date within window(2026-05-01, 2026-05-10) not precise enough for the day of sweep" (dd)
  unknown day: dd
  cut 2026-04-20
s_pin: 400.00 PLN
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-04-20
